Contention Governor

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Contention Governor is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for resolving cross-workload accelerator contention using interference evidence, policy, SLOs, workload value, fairness, and generation-fenced enforcement.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Contention Governor does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Contention Governor accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
